                (pullback (baseChange A (ModularCurve.TwoChart.modelTo A (↥K) j) (Localization.Away f)) s).Opens) : Set ↥(pullback (baseChange A (ModularCurve.TwoChart.modelTo A (↥K) j) (Localization.Away f)) s)) \
